agents statusline — Output a fast status line

USAGE
  agents statusline [claude|copilot|tmux|omp] [options]

ARGUMENTS
  [claude|copilot|tmux|omp]  Output target, not a subcommand (default: generic).

OPTIONS
  -h, --help
    Show this help and exit.

DEFAULTS
  Reads the local policy, usage cache, and Git branch.

ENVIRONMENT
  AGENTS_CONFIG, CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR, HOME: policy discovery; XDG_CACHE_HOME: usage cache.

EXAMPLES
  agents statusline claude
